flowchart LR
  A[Trigger: new input] --> B[Collect minimum context]
  B --> C[AI task: extract / classify / draft]
  C --> D{Schema + policy validation}
  D -->|Fail| E[Log failure and request correction]
  D -->|Pass, low risk| F[Deterministic action]
  D -->|Ambiguous or high impact| G[Human approval]
  G -->|Approve| F
  G -->|Reject| H[Revise or stop]
  F --> I[Notify owner + write audit log]
  E --> I
